{"branch":"산내점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">산내점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-110c991645f45f99.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"산내점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-110c991645f45f99.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>경기 파주시 청암로17번길 21 월드타워5 4층 405호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>산내마을중심상가(중)</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>산내마을중심상가(중)</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>산내마을3단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>산내마을3단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>산내마을6.8단지</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>산내마을6.8단지</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">일반</span></dt><dd><span>80</span><span>70-1</span><span>52</span><span>65</span><span>66</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">마을</span></dt><dd><span>070A</span><span>071</span><span>074</span><span>076</span><span>087</span><span>070B</span><span>072</span><span>080B</span><span>085</span><span>080A</span><span>079</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">광역</span></dt><dd><span>M7111</span><span>M7111(예약)</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">공항</span></dt><dd><span>5600</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">좌석</span></dt><dd><span>101</span></dd></div><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">직행</span></dt><dd><span>1500</span><span>1500(예약)</span><span>3100</span><span>3100N</span><span>7111(평일)</span><span>9030</span><span>9030-1</span></dd></div></dl></div><p class=\"kd-note\">주변 교통정보는 제공된 카카오맵 자료 기준입니다. 운행·정차 정보는 변경될 수 있습니다.</p>"}
